  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Thinly slice pear into wedges.\n• Thinly slice cucumber into sticks.\n• Cut Japanese tofu into 2cm chunks.\n• In a small bowl, combine garlic paste, soy sauce mix, the honey and plain flour.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6886bce8b6ffa7a20c3b936c/step-147c1f00.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. Cook tofu, tossing, until browned, 3-4 minutes.\n• Remove pan from heat, then add soy sauce mixture, tossing to coat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6886bce8b6ffa7a20c3b936c/step-ac37ec10.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, microwave mini flourtortillas on a microwave-safe plate in 10 second bursts until warmed through.\n• In a large bowl, combine pear, cucumber, slaw mix and a drizzle of vinegar and olive oil. Season with salt and pepper.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6886bce8b6ffa7a20c3b936c/step-5276a020.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Spread tortillas with garlic aioli.\n• Fill with pear slaw and honey-soy and garlic tofu.\n• Sprinkle over everything garnish (see ingredients) to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6886bce8b6ffa7a20c3b936c/step-7a878030.jpg"
    }
  ]
